  "honest_limits": [
    "Collinearity is tested BEFORE any GC reading is given, and the four-species case fails that test -- which is the non-vacuity check for the guard: it must reject the data that motivated building it.",
    "One genome per species, so a within-PHYLUM correlation is undefined wherever a phylum contributes a single genome. That is reported as undefined rather than as zero, because an undefined statistic read as a null result is how a sampling design becomes a finding.",
    "A correlation over a handful of phyla is a description of this corpus, not a law. GC is also only one axis of composition; it does not separate GC from codon usage, repeat content or gene density, all of which travel with it.",
    "This bounds the INSTRUMENT's margin against substrate composition and says nothing about any generator.",
    "Draft versus complete assemblies are mixed across the corpus, and contig fragmentation removes windows at breaks."
  ],
